      "writtenOn": "2024-01-11T10:50:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think that solve the issue since the sLastLogTime is updated by the handler thread.\nIf we call `sendStatsMessage` twice, there is no guarantee that sLastLogTime is updated between two `sendStatsMessage` calls.\n\nIf you think my another comment(https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Connectivity/+/2890277/comment/3fab0474_2cef22e3/) makes sense, I think this should solve the issue since lastLogTime will be accessed only from handler thread.",
