      "writtenOn": "2024-01-15T01:37:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Makes sense and done. \n\nBut just to make sure I didn\u0027t miss anything + taking into account the initial reason/concern for the revert: https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Connectivity/+/2868526/comment/8f18b233_635dc80d/, is it safe? maybe I should limit number of enqueued (CMD_SEND_MAYBE_ENQUEUE_NETWORK_REQUEST_STATE_METRIC) messages?",
      "parentUuid": "e0c762ee_e49ff119",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 108,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 117,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "9d2da9e7f769052af96fd3e85d923515f07ea3bb",
