      "writtenOn": "2024-01-15T03:03:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Processing of `CMD_SEND_MAYBE_ENQUEUE_NETWORK_REQUEST_STATE_METRIC` is not blocking handler thread and the size of `mPendingState` is limited, so I don\u0027t this current code has the issue previous code had.\n\nPreviously processing of `MSG_NETWORK_REQUEST_STATE_CHANGED` was blocking handler thread for 1sec and this could keep increasing the handler message queue.",
      "parentUuid": "52813055_8585992e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 108,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 117,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "9d2da9e7f769052af96fd3e85d923515f07ea3bb",
