      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought `onNetworkRequestReceived` and `onNetworkRequestRemoved` can just send message to handler thread and Handler can decide drop the metrics or put this metrics to the queue (and post delayed message to send the metrics).\nThis way, only the handler thread access PendingState queue and I feel this makes code simpler.",
