      "author": {
        "id": 1947461
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-11T10:10:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see, in that case, I think we can make NetworkRequestStateInfo a bit simpler.\nFor example, we don\u0027t need mNetworkRequestState.",
