        "id": 1947461
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-11T10:50:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we only collect metrics at requestRemoved, we can not know the information of apps that file network request but don\u0027t release request, I think.\nIs this ok for you?",
